{
  "title": "Ziyarah on the day of Arbaeen; The Twentieth of Safar",
  "code": "02",
  "data": "اَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰی وَلِیِّ اللّٰهِ وَ حَبِیْبِهٖ\nPeace be on the favorite of Allah,\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰی خَلِیْلِ اللّٰهِ وَ نَجِیْبِهٖ \nPeace be on the beloved friend of Allah, His distinguished hero!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰی صَفِیِّ اللّٰهِ وَ ابْنِ صَفِیِّهٖ \nPeace be on the choicest confidant of Allah, sincerely attached precisely like his father!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَی الْحُسَیْنِ الْمَظْلُوْمِ الشَّھِیْدِ \nPeace be on Husain, who gave his life in the way of Allah, a martyr, underwent untold hardships\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰی اَسِیْرِ الْكُرُبَاتِ وَ قَتِیْلِ الْعَبَرَاتِ \nPeace be on the hostage surrounded by the-tightening circle of sorrow and grief, killed by a horde of savages.\nاَللّٰھُمَّ اِنِّیْٓ اَشْھَدُ اَنَّهٗ وَلِیُّكَ وَ ابْنُ وَلِیِّكَ \nO my Allah! I give witness that beyond a shadow of doubt he is Your favorite and choicest confidant, who enjoys Your confidence and favor, precisely like his father!\nوَ صَفِیُّكَ وَ ابْنُ صَفِیِّكَ الْفَآئِزُ بِكَرَامَتِكَ \nYou looked upto him and elected him in Your cause,\nاَكْرَمْتَهٗ بِالشَّھَادَۃِ وَ حَبَوْتَهٗ بِالسَّعَادَۃِ \npicked and chose him for the good fortune, selected for him the best purified parents,\nوَ اجْتَبَیْتَهٗ بِطِیْبِ الْوِلَادَۃِ وَجَعَلْتَهٗ سَیِّدًا مِّنَ السَّادَۃِ \nappointed him guardian, leader, and defender of rights.\nوَ قَآئِدًا مِّنَ الْقَادَۃِ وَ ذَائِدًا مِّنَ الذَّادَۃِ \na true representative (inheritor and progenitor) of guardians, leaders and defenders of rights. \nوَ اَعْطَیْتَهٗ مَوَارِیْثَ الْاَنْبِیْآءِ وَ جَعَلْتَهٗ حُجَّۃً عَلٰی خَلْقِكَ مِنَ الْاَوْصِیَآءِ \ngave him much and more from the inheritance of the Prophets, put him forward as a decisive argument, along with the other successors (of the Holy Prophet-the twelve Imams) to the mankind.\nفَاعْذَرَ فِیْ الدُّعَآءِ وَ مَنَحَ النُّصْحَ وَ بَذَلَ مُھْجَتَهٗ فِیْكَ \nHe met with deadly dangers, acted justly and fairly, made use of everything belonging to him to pay full attention to give sincere advice, took pains, made every effort and put his heart, mind, soul and life at the disposal of Your mission\nلِیَسْتَنْقِذَ عِبَادَكَ مِنَ الْجَھَالَۃِ وَ حَیْرَۃِ الضَّلَا لَۃِ \nto liberate the people from the yoke of ignorance and evil of bewilderment, but an evildoer,\nوَ قَدْ تَوَازَرَ عَلَیْهِ مَنْ غَرَّتْهُ الدُّنْیَا \ndeceived with empty hopes of mean and worthless worldly gains, \nوَ بَاعَ حَظَّهٗ بِالْاَرْذَلِ الْاَدْنٰی \nhad pressed heavily on him, and sold out his share (eternal bliss)\nوَ شَرٰی اٰخِرَتَهٗ بِالثَّمَنِ الْاَوْكَسِ وَ تَغْطَرَسَ \nfor the meanest and lowest bargain, betrayed his “day of judgment” for a vulgar return,.\nوَ تَرَدّٰی فِیْ ھَوَاهُ وَ اَسْخَطَكَ وَ اَسْخَطَ نَبِیِّكَ \ntook pride In insolence, fell into the fathom-well of silly stupid follies, provoked You and Your Prophet to anger,\nوَ اَطَاعَ مِنْ عِبَادِكَ اَھْلَ الشِّقَاقِ وَ النِّفَاقِ \ndid as the harsh discordant, the hypocrite,\nوَ حَمَلَۃَ الْاَوْزَارِ الْمُسْتَوْجِبِیْنَ النَّارَ فَجَاھَدَھُمْ فِیْكَ \nthe heavily burdened bearers of sin, condemned to Hellfire, advised to him, however, he (the Holy Imam),\nصَابِرًا مُّحْتَسِبًا حَتّٰی سُفِكَ فِیْ طَاعَتِكَ دَمُهٗ \nsteadily, rightly and justly coped with them,\nوَ اسْتُبِیْحَ حَرِیْمُهٗ\ntill, in Your obedience, gave his life after which his family was set adrift.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ فَالْعَنْهُمْ لَعْنًا وَبِیْلاً وَّ عَذِّبْهُمْ عَذَابًا اَلِیْمًا \nO my Allah, therefore, condemn them to hell as a denunciation and conviction; and crack-down on them with a painful Punishment.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَابْنَ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ \nPeace be on you O the son of the Messenger of Allah!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَابْنَ سَیِّدِ الْاَوْصِیَآءِ \nPeace be on you 0 the son of the first of the successors (of the Holy Prophet)!\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ اَمِیْنُ اللّٰهِ وَ ابْنَ اَمِیْنِهٖ \nI bear witness that Allah put faith in you like He had full confidence in your father, and that you always looked for and collected good and virtue.\nعِشْتَ سَعِیْدًا وَ مَضَیْتَ حَمِیْدًا \nlived a highly praiseworthy life\nوَ مُتَّ فَقِیْدًا مَظْلُوْمًا شَهِیْدًا \nand departed from this world a martyr, forsaken and abused;\nوَ اَشْهَدُ اَنَّ اللّٰهَ مُنْجِزٌ مَّا وَعَدَكَ وَ مُهْلِكٌ مَّنْ خَذَلَكَ \nI bear witness that Allah will promptly fulfill the promise, He made to you,\nوَ مُعَذِّبٌ مَّنْ قَتَلَكَ وَ اَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ وَفَیْتَ بِعَهْدِ اللّٰهِ \nand destroy those who left you helpless and punish those who killed you; I bear witness that you kept your promise made with Allah,\nوَ جَاهَدْتَ فِیْ سَبِیْلِهٖ حَتّٰی اَتٰیكَ الْیَقِیْنُ \nand strived in His way till what was certain came upon you,\nفَلَعَنَ اللّٰهُ مَنْ قَتَلَكَ وَ لَعَنَ اللّٰهُ مَنْ ظَلَمَكَ \nso curse of Allah be on those who killed you, curse of Allah be on those who oppressed you,\nوَ لَعَنَ اللّٰهُ اُمَّۃً سَمِعَتْ بِذٰلِكَ فَرَضِیَتْ بِهٖ \ncurse of Allah be on the people who came to know and approved\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اُشْهِدُكَ اَنِّیْ وَلِیٌّ لِّمَنْ وَالَاهُ وَ عَدُوٌّ لِّمَنْ عَادَاهُ \nO my Allah be my witness that I make friends with those who love him and oppose those who deny him.\nبِاَبِیْ اَنْتَ وَ اُمِّیْ یَابْنَ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ \nI, my father and mother, are at your disposal O the son of the Messenger of Allah.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ كُنْتَ نُوْرًا فِیْ الْاَصْلَابِ الشَّامِخَۃِ \nI know and bear witness that you were “light” in the sublime loins\nوَ الْاَرْحَامِ الْمُطَهَّرَۃِ \nand in the pure wombs,\nلَمْ تُنَجِّسْكَ الْجَاهِلِیَّۃُ بِاَنْجَاسِهَا \nnever touched you the dirt of ignorance,\nوَ لَمْ تُلْبِسْكَ الْمُدْلَهِمَّاتُ مِنْ ثِیَابِهَا \nnor ever obscurity concealed you in its folds;\nوَ اَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ مِنْ دَعَآئِمِ الدِّیْنِ وَ اَرْكَانِ الْمُسْلِمِیْنَ \nI bear witness that you are the pillar of “Deen”, support of the Muslims,\nوَ مَعْقِلِ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ وَ اَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ الْاِمَامُ الْبَرُّ التَّقِیُّ الرَّضِیُّ الزَّكِیُّ \nrefuge of the faithful; I bear witness that you are a truthful, well-aware, content, intelligent,\nالْهَادِیْ الْمَهْدِیُّ وَ اَشْهَدُ اَنَّ الْاَئِمَّۃَ مِنْ وُلْدِكَ \nrightly guided guide (Imam); I bear witness that the Imams among your descendants\nكَلِمَۃُ التَّقْوٰی وَ اَعْلَامُ الْهُدٰی وَ الْعُرْوَۃُ الْوُثْقٰی \nare the symbols of “conscious piety” and signs of “true guidance”, the “safe handle” – lslam,\nوَ الْحُجَّۃُ عَلٰی اَهْلِ الدُّنْیَا وَ اَشْهَدُ اَنِّیْ بِكُمْ مُؤْمِنٌ \nand the decisive arguments over mankind; I declare positively that I have full faith in you\nوَّ بِاِیَابِكُمْ مُوْقِنٌۢ بِشَرَایِعِ دِیْنِیْ وَ خَوَاتِیْمِ عَمَلِیْ \nand I know for certain that you shall return. I am, fully committed to the laws of my religion, certain of my deeds,\nوَ قَلْبِیْ لِقَلْبِكُمْ سِلْمٌ وَّ اَمْرِیْ لِاَمْرِكُمْ مُتَّبِعٌ \nmy mind and heart ready for your return,\nوَّ نُصْرَتِیْ لَكُمْ مُعَدَّۃٌ \nand my affairs carried out in the light of your instructions,\nحَتّٰی یَاْذَنَ اللّٰهُ لَكُمْ \ntill Allah gives you permission, together with you,\nفَمَعَكُمْ مَعَكُمْ لَا مَعَ عَدُوِّكُمْ صَلَوَاتُ اللّٰهِ عَلَیْكُمْ \nalong with you, not at the same time with your enemies. Blessings of Allah be on you,\nوَ عَلٰی اَرْوَاحِكُمْ وَ اَجْسَادِكُمْ وَ شَاهِدِكُمْ وَ غَآئِبِكُمْ \non your souls, on your bodies when you are visible, when you are invisible, on your perceivable aspects,\nوَ ظَاهِرِكُمْ وَ بَاطِنِكُمْ اٰمِیْنَ رَبَّ الْعَالَمِیْنَ.\non your innermost genius be it so, O Lord of the worlds."
}
